---
description: No secrets in git, logs, or source
alwaysApply: true
---

# Secrets

Do

- Use local/mock fallbacks so the app runs without credentials.
- Keep `.env` out of git; commit `.env.example` with dummy keys only if needed.

Don’t

- Commit API keys, tokens, or real `.env` files.
- Print secrets in logs, README, or chat replies.
